   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Evil Star**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Cyboogie**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Real’s Not Real**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **The Bird Song**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Venusian 1 [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2019-07-12** (recommended): soundboard; 18 songs; 112 min [1]\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-adelaide-19**: source not stated; 18 songs; 112 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Adam Halliwell played flute on Hot Water and Head On/Pill [2]\n- This performance is identified as the earliest known performance of the set [6]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2019-07-12**: taped by Sam Joseph, Stacey Wilson; source: SBD > WAV [1]. Also: Recorded by Sam Joseph and the band's sound crew at the venue [1]\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-adelaide-19**: Sam Joseph and Stacey Wilson recorded the full show for the official series [2]",
